WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.910
In Jesus' time, a person with
leprosy had to live apart,

2
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.820
and call out a warning: Unclean!

3
00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:11.120
Tax collectors working for Rome
were seen as cheats and traitors.

4
00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:13.730
Respectable people kept their distance.

5
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:17.840
Yet the Gospels say Jesus touched
a leper before he was healed.

6
00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.160
And he ate with tax collectors.

7
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:23.890
So why did Jesus go to the
people others kept away?

8
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:28.620
In this mission, you'll follow his
encounters with people others pushed away.

9
00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.010
Then you'll see how Christians
follow his example today,

10
00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.750
from hospices to prison chaplaincy.

11
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:40.280
Your mission: find out why Jesus touched
lepers and ate with cheats when respectable

12
00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:41.640
people kept away.
